# In tests, always assert on the retrieved content (preference)

Standing user preference: In tests, always assert on the retrieved content itself — asserting only that a version number bumped is a false green when retrieval status is degraded; content retrievability must be verified directly.

## Conventions
- In tests, always assert on the retrieved content itself — asserting only that a version number bumped is a false green when retrieval status is degraded; content retrievability must be verified directly.

